# Octicons (octicons)
# font: https://github.com/ryanoasis/nerd-fonts/releases/latest/download/NerdFontsSymbolsOnly.zip
# metadata: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ryanoasis/nerd-fonts/master/glyphnames.json
# license: MIT
# note: Taken from the Nerd Fonts `oct-` range rather than a Primer release:
# note: Primer removed the icon font at Octicons v9 and publishes SVG only.
# note: Names are normalised to Primer's spelling, so `arrow-down` rather than the `oct-arrow_down`
# note: Nerd Fonts uses.
